  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vikas Gulati vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 27 July, 2023 Author: Prem Narayan Singh Bench: Prem Narayan Singh 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Crr No. 3306 of 2023 (Vikas Gulati Vs The State Of Madhya Prad Dated : 27-07-2023",
    "facts": "Heard on I.A. No. 11287/2023, which is an application filed under Section 397 read with Section 401 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 for suspension of jail sentence and grant of bail on behalf of applicant. 2. The applicant has been convicted under Section 16(1)(a)(i) and (ii) read with Section 7(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 and sentenced to undergo 1 years R.I. with fine of Rs.10,000/- in each sentence and usual default stipulations.",
    "arguments": "5 . Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that the Courts below have not properly appreciated the oral and documentary evidence available on record and committed error in convicting the applicant.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "5 . Learned counsel for the applicant submitted that the Courts below have not properly appreciated the oral and documentary evidence available on record and committed error in convicting the applicant.",
